asr-000035
00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.650
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: esteemed colleagues,

asr-000036
00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:27.650
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: good afternoon.

asr-000037
00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:28.650
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: I would like to welcome everyone

asr-000038
00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:33.770
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Welcome everyone to this budget hearing of the Commission on Elections headed by Chairman George

asr-000039
00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:39.850
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Erwin M. Garcia. The budget of the Commission on Elections for fiscal year 2027 amounting

asr-000040
00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:45.930
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: to 29.5 billion pesos, inclusive of the automatic appropriations for retirement and life insurance

asr-000041
00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:53.930
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: premiums amounting to 339.88 million pesos. In terms of new appropriations, which is subject

asr-000042
00:01:53.930 --> 00:02:00.570
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: for congressional approval, the total budget of the COMELEC amounts to 29.16 billion pesos

asr-000043
00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:08.490
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: representing an increase of about 46.7 percent or 9.3 billion pesos higher than the

asr-000044
00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:17.530
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: fiscal year 2026 level of 19.87 billion pesos 23.92 billion pesos for the preparatory national

asr-000045
00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:23.850
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and local elections is included for the preparations for the 2028 elections.

asr-000046
00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:30.090
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: The COMELEC is the principal government agency tasked to enforce and administer all laws and

asr-000047
00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:36.090
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: regulations concerning the conduct of regular and special elections. Under our Constitution,

asr-000048
00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:40.650
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: it is a body designed to be independent from the executive, legislative, and

asr-000049
00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:45.450
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: judicial branches of government to ensure the conduct of free, fair, and honest elections.

asr-000050
00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:51.770
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: More importantly, our Constitution grants fiscal autonomy to the COMELEC to enable them to operate

asr-000051
00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.930
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: effectively, efficiently, and free

asr-000052
00:02:53.930 --> 00:03:01.130
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: from political interference. It provides that funds certified by the Commission as necessary

asr-000053
00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:07.610
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: to defray the expenses for holding regular and special elections, plebiscites, initiatives, referenda

asr-000054
00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:12.570
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and recalls will be provided in the regular or special appropriations

asr-000055
00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:17.690
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and once approved, will be released automatically upon certification by the Chairman of the

asr-000056
00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:22.890
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Commission. With the presence of our COMELEC officials, we look forward to an efficient and

asr-000057
00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:29.770
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: fruitful discussion. Thank you po.

asr-000058
00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:32.250
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia, you may now proceed with your presentation.

asr-000059
00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.010
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: mr chair your honors

asr-000060
00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:49.370
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: budget for the 2027 year and which will happen to be the year prior to the election of 2028

asr-000061
00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:54.410
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: initial statement i would like to respectfully announce to you

asr-000062
00:03:55.210 --> 00:04:01.750
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Commission election during the last year of fiscal year 2025. For 2025, of course, we conducted the

asr-000063
00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:07.290
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: national and local elections, a very successful election. It was actually the fastest in the

asr-000064
00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:13.710
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: history of our country in a midterm election. We were able to proclaim the senator in five days.

asr-000065
00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:18.370
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We were able to proclaim the mayors and the governors on the night of the election or the

asr-000066
00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:23.830
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: next day after the election. We were able to proclaim the party's congressman seven days

asr-000067
00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:31.950
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: after the election. Indeed, actually, it likewise resulted to an 81.7 percent. Voters turned out the

asr-000068
00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:38.170
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: highest in a midterm election. Our highest was the 2022 election, the presidential election, which

asr-000069
00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:47.410
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: was actually 83 percent. Your Comelec was likewise awarded the commission of the year by an

asr-000070
00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:53.710
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: international body, and it was likewise recognized by electing us for the first time in the history

asr-000074
00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:58.690
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Comelec, and the history likewise of the world electoral body and the association of electoral

asr-000075
00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:07.310
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: authorities. The Comelec was elected both chairperson in both of these world electoral bodies. So we

asr-000076
00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:15.510
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: will be assuming chairmanship by the month of October. That's actually a recognition, perhaps,

asr-000077
00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:21.550
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: of what the Comelec is doing, and perhaps they're likewise using the Comelec's model as their model

asr-000078
00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:23.470
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: in the conduct of their election.

asr-000079
00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:35.030
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Likewise, for the information of this honorable body, your Comelec for three consecutive years, first time po, three consecutive years, we were given an unqualified opinion by the Commission on Audit.

asr-000080
00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:40.510
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Meaning to say, kahit paano po, maayos yung pananalapinang Comelec, maayos yung libro namin.

asr-000081
00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:51.430
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And therefore, that is because we wanted to ensure the greatest transparency that is possible for purposes of at least expending the people's money.

asr-000082
00:05:51.430 --> 00:06:14.030
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And likewise, in the recent survey conducted by a survey organization, we were given likewise an 81.65%, a 96% trust rating when it comes to the machines, and likewise a 67% trust rating when it comes to the Commission on Election.

asr-000083
00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:21.030
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: For the 2025, our absorptive capacity or financial utilization rate is 99.73%.

asr-000084
00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:26.490
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Medyo mataas po yung 2025 namin na financial utilization.

asr-000085
00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:31.210
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And yung case disposition po namin is 62.47%.

asr-000086
00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:38.630
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: In 2025, the number of cases that reached the Comelec was about 14,000.

asr-000087
00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:45.050
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ngayon po, ang amin pong cases na lamang, especially sa Club of the Commission, mga more or less 400 na lamang po.

asr-000088
00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:50.750
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung mga cases to be disposed by the Commission on Election, regardless of the nature of the cases.

asr-000089
00:06:50.750 --> 00:07:02.650
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Now, when it comes to our proposal for 2027 fiscal year, we would like to respectfully appeal to the kindness of this honorable committee.

asr-000090
00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:11.050
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We were reduced by as much as almost, yung pong budget namin was reduced by as much as almost 23 billion pesos.

asr-000091
00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:18.830
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: In fact, dun lang po sa preparatory national and local election, we were reduced by about 9 billion pesos.

asr-000092
00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.690
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sinama pa po natin.

asr-000093
00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:29.170
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung budget para sa Comelec of about 6 billion, yung regular budget namin, 15 billion po yung tinanggal sa amin, sa NEP.

asr-000094
00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:37.670
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And that is so unfortunate because I'm going to explain with your kind permission, ano-ano po ba yung mga tinanggal na yun na maaari po maka-apekto.

asr-000095
00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:41.190
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi ko na po muna sasabing maka-apekto. Gamitin ko na lang po muna yung word.

asr-000096
00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:46.950
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: It may definitely affect the conduct of our election for 2028.

asr-000097
00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:48.070
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ito po yun.

asr-000108
00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:54.050
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Registered voters as projected by 2028 is more or less 74 million.

asr-000109
00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.090
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 74 million na po tayo.

asr-000110
00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:58.530
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa kasalukuyan, 71 million po tayo.

asr-000111
00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:02.470
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nung pong 2028, 2025 election, 68 million.

asr-000112
00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:10.570
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And then because of our continuing registration, yung pinagkaabalahan talaga ng Comelec, tumaas po ito hanggang 71 million voters.

asr-000113
00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:18.390
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ngayon po, by 2028, we are projecting a 74 million number of registered voters.

asr-000114
00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:26.690
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pag po 74 million number of registered voters, ibig sabihin po, tataas ang bilang ng mga presinto ng ating pong bansa.

asr-000115
00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:37.450
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nung nakarang election, we will readily admit, masyado pong mahaba ang pila, sapagkat kinakailangan kung ano po yung budget na nabigay sa amin, yun lang po ang perpwede naming ma-lease ng mga machines.

asr-000116
00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.730
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Umabot lang po kami ng 800 to 1,000 voters.

asr-000117
00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:41.870
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Try to imagine that.

asr-000118
00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:47.190
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Simply because we were just limited to 107,000 precincts nationwide.

asr-000119
00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:48.150
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Diyan po.

asr-000120
00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:53.610
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Halos 7,000 ang aming pong excess machines pang palit kung sakasakali.

asr-000121
00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:56.550
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And we have 101,000 precincts nationwide.

asr-000122
00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:58.090
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero kulang na kulang po.

asr-000123
00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:04.830
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ngayon po, kung sakasakaling masusunod po yung binigay sa aming budget, nababawasan po kami ng 9 billion.

asr-000124
00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:10.730
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: With your kind permission, may I invite your attention sa ating pong screen.

asr-000125
00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:15.850
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Una pong binawasan sa amin, your honors, yung pong aming machines.

asr-000126
00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:17.470
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung ating pong machines.

asr-000127
00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:27.590
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: For the first time in the history of our country's automated election, simula po ng 2010, sa 2025 elections, hindi po tayo bumili ng machines.

asr-000128
00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.310
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nag-list lang po tayo ng machines.

asr-000129
00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:39.570
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And because of the list of the machines, ang aming pong market scoping, market survey, dapat 155,000 pesos per machine.

asr-000130
00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:47.450
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: But doong lumabas po yung mismong procurement, lumalabas po 149,000 lamang ang naging offer sa amin.

asr-000131
00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:54.510
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So we were able to at least save 800 million pesos because of the list of machines.

asr-000132
00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:59.470
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pag po hindi tayo bumili ng machines, number one, hindi po tayo nagwe-warehouse.

asr-000133
00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Number two, hindi po tayo nag-upgrade.

asr-000134
00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:03.070
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Napaka-importante.

asr-000135
00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:06.830
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi rin po tayo nag-maintain ng ating mga makina.

asr-000136
00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:15.390
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Napaka-importante po yan because napaka-mahal po ng warehousing, ng maintenance, at saka po improvement of the machines.

asr-000137
00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.690
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So nag-list lang po tayo.

asr-000138
00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:29.590
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And after the 2025 election, one-time use, meaning after the 2025 elections, there will be a separate and a different provider by 2028 based on the new terms of reference.

asr-000139
00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:32.690
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung kaya lang po, nakat po ng 1.5 billion.

asr-000140
00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:42.350
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang 1.5 billion po is equivalent to more or less, short po kami, ng 9,000, your honors, 310 machines.

asr-000141
00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:46.590
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: As for a greater appreciation.

asr-000142
00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:52.030
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We hope to be able to start the filing of the candidacies by next year.

asr-000143
00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:56.290
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dapat po ay October 1 to 7 tayo ng 2025.

asr-000144
00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:01.930
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ngayon po, we wanted to have the filing of the candidacy by September 20 to 27.

asr-000145
00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:03.790
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: More or less yung po yung filing natin.

asr-000146
00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:05.750
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Mas maaga ng ilang araw lang.

asr-000147
00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:06.830
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Bakit po?

asr-000148
00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:11.530
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Because we wanted to print the ballots by December of 2027.

asr-000149
00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:16.270
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung pong pinopropose sa amin, and I will explain later,

asr-000150
00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:22.110
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: gusto po nilang mangyari na 2028 na lang kami mag-print ng balota.

asr-000151
00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:32.850
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kaya po importante yung 2027 September because pag natapos po kami ng registration of voters likewise by September 30,

asr-000152
00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:40.490
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: we wanted to finalize the list of voters ng bawat distrito niyo po, we wanted to finalize by the month of November.

asr-000153
00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:43.150
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dapat po nakapag-cleansing na kami.

asr-000154
00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:45.490
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dapat po pumasok na yung mga petisyon for exclusivity.

asr-000155
00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:48.230
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Inclusion sa mga courts.

asr-000156
00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:52.430
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dapat po malinis na ang list of voters natin by November of 2027.

asr-000157
00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:52.930
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Why?

asr-000158
00:11:53.410 --> 00:12:00.530
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Because we wanted to print the ballots by the second week or even kahit po Christmas time by third week of December.

asr-000159
00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:09.830
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Because we wanted to avoid what happened in 2026 na nag-filing po tayo ng candidacy no October 1 to 7.

asr-000160
00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:14.750
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nag-hintay po kami kung ano ang aksyon sa mga dinisqualify namin.

asr-000161
00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:16.030
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Especially yung mga disqualify.

asr-000162
00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:18.110
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Diniclare namin NUISAN's candidates.

asr-000163
00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:27.510
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And we'd like to announce to you for 2025, wala po kami kahit isa na NUISAN's candidates.

asr-000164
00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:35.870
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We were able to resolve the 153 NUISAN's cases all in all up to the NBank level by November 30.

asr-000165
00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:42.150
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Meaning to say, pagdating po ng 1st of December, handa na po kami sa list of voters.

asr-000166
00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:46.050
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pag po automated election, we have to print the names.

asr-000167
00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:48.850
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Of the candidates sa balota natin.

asr-000168
00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:53.770
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And therefore, we cannot afford an injunction, a restraining order from the Supreme Court.

asr-000169
00:12:54.230 --> 00:13:01.430
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: What happened in 2025 was that, second week of January, nag-print na po kami na more or less 6 million ballots.

asr-000170
00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:08.190
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Then, a restraining order was issued as against the Comelec in favor of one candidate for national position.

asr-000171
00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:10.550
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala po sanong problema kung local.

asr-000172
00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:12.590
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kasi hindi pa naman po kami nagsisimula.

asr-000173
00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:15.550
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Doon sa mga local positions na...

asr-000174
00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.710
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Na nakakuha ng restraining order.

asr-000175
00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:21.530
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero sa national po, meron kasing nakakuha ng isang restraining order.

asr-000176
00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:23.410
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Then, we have to comply.

asr-000177
00:13:23.890 --> 00:13:29.090
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We have to reprint anew the ballot so that the name of that candidate will have to be included.

asr-000178
00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:30.590
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Doon sa list.

asr-000179
00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:33.370
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So ngayon po gusto namin sana mas maaga tayo mag-file.

asr-000180
00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:37.350
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Para maaga po namin makumpleto ang list of candidates.

asr-000181
00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:40.750
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At the same time, makumpleto rin yung list of voters po natin.

asr-000182
00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:45.670
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So therefore, critical po ang 2027 sa preparation natin.

asr-000183
00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:49.890
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi po dapat pinagkakasya ang lahat sa 2028.

asr-000184
00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.070
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kasi po sa 2028, kung ang election natin is May,

asr-000185
00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:58.470
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: napakahira po na January, February, March, magpuprint ka ng balota.

asr-000186
00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:00.150
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pag may nagka-problema, you have to repeat.

asr-000187
00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:03.290
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And magkakakompromise yung printing natin ng balota.

asr-000188
00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.270
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So dito po sa makina namin, ang projection po namin,

asr-000189
00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:09.870
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa 1.51 billion,

asr-000190
00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:16.270
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung pong dapat na machines natin for 2028 election ay 124,000.

asr-000191
00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:24.570
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: But because of the cut of from 23 billion to 16, magiging 21.66,

asr-000192
00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:29.070
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 8,000 po more or less ang mawawalang machines sa Comelec.

asr-000193
00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.690
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pagka po hindi po naibalik sa amin yun,

asr-000194
00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:36.770
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: we will resort to likewise increasing the number of voters per precinct muli.

asr-000195
00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:40.930
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang plano po sana ni Comelec, 600 voters lang per precinct.

asr-000196
00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:44.870
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Para po mas maliging maayos ang pagboto ng mga kababayan natin.

asr-000197
00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:45.990
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: But if not,

asr-000198
00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:49.690
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: the budget will not be restored, 800 to 1,000 pumuli.

asr-000199
00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:54.190
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So masisisi na naman po si Comelec bakit ganun kadami ang votante per precinct,

asr-000200
00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:56.390
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: kahit yung mga nakatatanda may kapansanan,

asr-000201
00:14:56.390 --> 00:15:00.190
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: simply because what was given to us only was

asr-000202
00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.920
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 21.66 billion, less than 1.51 billion.

asr-000203
00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:15.500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So ang sa amin po, ito po talaga ipinapakiusap namin na sana man lang makapag-list tayo ng 124,310 machines

asr-000204
00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:19.380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sapagkat yung 10,000 po dyan ay contingency machines.

asr-000205
00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.260
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We need contingency machines.

asr-000206
00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:32.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: For the first time also in 2025, your honors, tayo po ay nagkaroon ng 10 machines bawat munisipyo as contingency.

asr-000207
00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:37.660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nagkaroon din po tayo ng contingency machines sa lahat ng provincial offices of the commission.

asr-000208
00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:45.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Meaning to say, kung nagka-problema sa Cebu halimbawa na anuman po ang nangyari, naandyan lagi yung machine na pwede namin ipampalit.

asr-000209
00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:50.380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala po tayong naging problema na major during the last election of 2025.

asr-000210
00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:55.460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: That's why it's the fastest election in the history without sacrificing the credibility.

asr-000211
00:15:56.120 --> 00:16:04.680
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: In fact, ang ating po random manual audit resulted to a 99.999973% accuracy rating.

asr-000212
00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:14.340
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And yung po ang pinakamataas so far na accuracy ng ating po machine versus the manual count of the ballot since 2010.

asr-000213
00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:18.560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung po next, your honors, if I may please invite your attention.

asr-000214
00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.260
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Na tinanggal po sa amin.

asr-000215
00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:22.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: E yung pong printing of ballots.

asr-000216
00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:26.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ibig sabihin po, ang nire-request po namin is 3.2 billion.

asr-000217
00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:32.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 1.7 billion po dyan, your honors, ay printing ng official ballots.

asr-000218
00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:34.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 1.7 to 1.8.

asr-000219
00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:38.240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At 800 million po ang ating voters information sheet.

asr-000220
00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:42.100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yan po yung four pages na pinamamahagi natin sa lahat ng botante.

asr-000221
00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:43.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: That's 888 million pesos.

asr-000222
00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:48.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At pagkatapos po, magpiprint din kami ng pampaskil sa labas ng presinto na list of voters.

asr-000223
00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:50.180
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At yung mismo nasa loob.

asr-000224
00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:53.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Na list kung saan pumipirma yung mga botante natin.

asr-000225
00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: That's why we asked for 3.2 billion.

asr-000226
00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:59.540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Binigyan lang po kami, your honors, ng 348.

asr-000227
00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:01.740
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 348.

asr-000228
00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:07.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ibig sabihin po, hindi po kami makakapagprint ng balota by 2027.

asr-000229
00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:14.320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Meaning po, kung ano man po yung kailangan printing, sa 2027 namin i-request for 2028 budget.

asr-000230
00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:19.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Therefore, makakapag-start lang po kami ng procurement, kahit po yan ay National Printing Office,

asr-000231
00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:25.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: still we have to conduct procurement process by January of 2028.

asr-000232
00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:28.860
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kahit pa nga po mag-early procurement, short of award kami.

asr-000233
00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:32.380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Meaning, no printing can be done by Comelec.

asr-000234
00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:36.960
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung binigyan po kami ng 348, ano lang po mapiprint namin doon?

asr-000235
00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:39.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Siguro po mapiprint namin doon, list of voters.

asr-000236
00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:43.300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yun lang po mapiprint namin, but not the ballots.

asr-000237
00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:47.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, critical po na maiprepare na natin ang ballots by December,

asr-000238
00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: so that by February, tapos po ang printing ng balota natin.

asr-000239
00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:55.540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Naka-standby na lahat, because at least final naman po yung list of candidates natin.

asr-000240
00:17:55.900 --> 00:18:00.640
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Even if may mga i-disqualify, whether by the Comelec or the Supreme Court, just the same,

asr-000241
00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:05.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: kung nakaprint na po yung pangalan ng kandidato, wala pong rights na mababayolate

asr-000242
00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:10.500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: because, just the same, madedeclare na lang ma-estray ang voto sa mga kandidato ngayon.

asr-000243
00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:17.340
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, again, tinanggalan po kami ng more or less 2.93 billion pesos sa printing.

asr-000244
00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:20.340
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We wanted to start again by December of 2020.

asr-000245
00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:31.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung pong deployment at saka logistics, as early as 2027 po, may mga dine-deploy na po tayo, especially overseas.

asr-000246
00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:38.380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kasi po ang overseas voting po natin, although tayo po ay magpapa-internet voting na muli sa overseas,

asr-000247
00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:46.500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ay kinakailang mag-deploy rin po kami ng mga machines at kahit yung mga kiosk.

asr-000248
00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:54.560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kasi nga po, may mga kababayan tayo, especially in Hong Kong and Singapore, sa mga kiosk sila ng embahada at konsulada bumoboto.

asr-000249
00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:59.460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kahit pa may access sila sa laptops, iPads, cellphone, meron naman po silang sarili.

asr-000250
00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:06.660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung iba po, pag nagsasama-sama pag Sunday, gusto po sa mga kiosk, we have to deploy all of this by 2027.

asr-000251
00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:14.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Likewise, magkakaroon po kami ng mga, at alam nyo naman po yan, yung honors, yung pong mga tinatawag na test,

asr-000252
00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:16.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: including yung mga mock elections.

asr-000253
00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:20.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pag nagpapamak-election po tayo, nagde-deploy din po tayo ng mga kagamitan.

asr-000254
00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:27.520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala po kami magagamit kasi binigyan lang po kami ng 127 million of the 2.63.

asr-000255
00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:30.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And meron pa po tayong demo ballots.

asr-000256
00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:34.700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang demo ballots po natin, kalimitan, mga more or less 1 million.

asr-000257
00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:39.640
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So wala po kami pang-print, wala rin po kami pang-deploy sa mga demo ballots.

asr-000258
00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:45.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So just to underscore the importance of what was removed from the commission on election,

asr-000259
00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:49.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: hindi na po kami mangihinge doon sa tinanggal na sa amin.

asr-000260
00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Masakit na yung mismong agency budget.

asr-000261
00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:56.660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero yung pong preparatory, national, and local, we cannot compromise that because that will compromise the election.

asr-000262
00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:06.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Supplies, tingnan nyo naman po from 973 year honors, binigyan lang po kami ng 167, a reduction of 806 million pesos.

asr-000263
00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:12.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung pong packaging services, yung pong mga balota natin, kung napansin nyo po, especially at the time na kayo ay tumatakbo.

asr-000264
00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:15.960
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ibang klase po kasi yung packaging natin.

asr-000265
00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:22.440
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi po ordinary packaging yun because we do not want the integrity of the ballots being compromised.

asr-000266
00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:26.440
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nakabak yung pakta po yun, yung mga balota natin.

asr-000267
00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:31.940
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Siyempre po kung mag-print na kami by 2027, ipa-impake na po namin yun.

asr-000268
00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:38.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Paano po kung nag-print tayo, binigyan nyo nga po kami ng dagdag na budget sa printing kung hindi rin naman po yan may impake.

asr-000269
00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:40.380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Masisira po yung mga balota.

asr-000270
00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:44.380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So isipin nyo po yung tinanggal sa amin para doon po sa...

asr-000271
00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:49.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa budget na yun, ay ganun na lang po kalaki.

asr-000272
00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:54.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: From 216, naging 154, kulang po kami ng 61.4.

asr-000273
00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:57.100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung pong international certification.

asr-000274
00:20:57.320 --> 00:21:00.080
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ito po, alam na alam po ni na Congressman Percy.

asr-000275
00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:10.440
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Under Republic Act 9369, the Comelec should have international certification and TEC certification six months before the election.

asr-000276
00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:13.520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero bago po kayo ma-issue na certification na yan,

asr-000277
00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:18.380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: meron pong mga kondisyon na dapat ma-undergo ng ating sistema.

asr-000278
00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:25.520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang sinasabi po nila sa binigay po sa aming budget, sa 2028 na kayo magpa-certify.

asr-000279
00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:27.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi po kakayanin yun.

asr-000280
00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:36.720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang certification po ay 2027 kasi po lahat po, election, yung pong source code review, yung pong etc. etc. lahat,

asr-000281
00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:40.740
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: kinakailang ma-undergo muna bago po tayo magkaroon ng certification.

asr-000282
00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.740
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Isipin nyo po, from 163 ginawang...

asr-000283
00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:52.700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nung nakarang election po, ang ating na pong binayad para sa international certification is more or less 160 million.

asr-000284
00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:55.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Tapos nireduce po kami sa 137.

asr-000285
00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:59.640
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: International testing body po yun.

asr-000286
00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:03.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung pong nakalagay sa batas eh, dapat international testing body.

asr-000287
00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:09.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi po pwedeng local dahil wala po pa po tayong local na nag-tetest dito sa ating bansa.

asr-000288
00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:12.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At yung pong overtime namin.

asr-000289
00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:19.220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa Comilic po, pag nag-overtime ang lahat ng mga empleyado because of the preparation, it's almost 200 million.

asr-000290
00:22:19.760 --> 00:22:22.240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung 6 months po yan, that's 1.2 billion.

asr-000291
00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:27.300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Binigyan lang po kami ng 867, kulang po kami ng 330.

asr-000292
00:22:27.460 --> 00:22:30.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: That's only 5 months na overtime for next year.

asr-000293
00:22:30.900 --> 00:22:42.720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And then, after po ng overtime, tingnan nyo po yung lease of warehouse and venues.

asr-000294
00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:51.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang filing po ng candidacy for national kasama po ang party lease, ginagawa po namin sa isang malaking venue.

asr-000295
00:22:51.600 --> 00:22:55.720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nung nakaraan po, matatandaan ng lahat, doon po sa tent ng Manila Hotel.

asr-000296
00:22:56.420 --> 00:23:00.240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala po kasi si Comilic na sariling venue dahil wala po kaming building.

asr-000297
00:23:01.320 --> 00:23:04.120
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kami po ay nangungupahan lang sa Palacio del Gobernador.

asr-000298
00:23:04.280 --> 00:23:07.200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And therefore, kinakailangan po kami mag-lease.

asr-000299
00:23:07.840 --> 00:23:11.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung wala pong siniro po kami doon eh, tingnan nyo po your honors, Mr. Chair.

asr-000300
00:23:11.900 --> 00:23:13.140
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Lease of warehouse and venues.

asr-000301
00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:14.860
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung warehouse, siro po kami.

asr-000302
00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:19.740
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 118 po yung aming nire-request, siro po yung binigay sa amin.

asr-000303
00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:23.720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Therefore, saan po kami magpapafile ng certificates of candidacy sa national?

asr-000304
00:23:24.060 --> 00:23:25.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala pong problema sa local.

asr-000305
00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:27.280
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa mga local, Comilic ang filing.

asr-000306
00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:31.840
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: O kung hindi ba, minsan pinapahiram kami ng mga gym or basketball courts.

asr-000307
00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:38.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero sa national, for senators, for president and vice president, and for the party lease, namumblema po kami

asr-000308
00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:42.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: dahil wala po kaming malaking space to conduct the filing of the candidacy.

asr-000309
00:23:43.140 --> 00:23:46.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung pong lease na lang po noong nakarang election, that's 31 million.

asr-000310
