00:24:08.960 --> 00:24:10.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung training of trainers.

asr-000319
00:24:10.340 --> 00:24:12.300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: DOSC certification conferences.

asr-000320
00:24:13.140 --> 00:24:14.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala po kami mati-train ng mga trainers.

