00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:16.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Negative din po.

asr-000322
00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:18.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Zero din po ang binigay po sa amin.

asr-000323
00:24:18.900 --> 00:24:24.940
