asr-000340
00:25:09.280 --> 00:25:10.680
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala po kami pwedeng maipagawa.

asr-000341
00:25:10.680 --> 00:25:11.460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Zero po kami.

asr-000342
00:25:12.280 --> 00:25:12.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: For your information,

