asr-001518
01:17:51.820 --> 01:17:54.220
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: ay mag-pre-prescribe na iyan sa 2027, tama ba?

asr-001519
01:17:55.020 --> 01:17:58.960
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So long as we are able to start already the process,

asr-001520
01:17:58.960 --> 01:18:05.380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: wala pong hindi po mag-pre-prescribe yung five-year na prescriptive period.

asr-001521
01:18:05.860 --> 01:18:11.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kasi yung five-year prescriptive period po is from the moment of the commission of the alleged election offense.

asr-001522
01:18:11.140 --> 01:18:14.700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung walang kilos si Comelec, wala man lang pong initiation,

asr-001523
01:18:15.160 --> 01:18:17.540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: wala namang election, wala pong preliminary investigation,

asr-001524
01:18:18.100 --> 01:18:23.440
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: then [unclear] po talaga. Mai-invoke po sa amin yung napakaraming desisyon ng Supreme Court

asr-001525
01:18:23.440 --> 01:18:26.300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: on the speedy disposition of cases.

asr-001526
01:18:26.300 --> 01:18:27.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: But once nagsimula na po kami,

asr-001527
01:18:28.240 --> 01:18:28.940
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: hindi na po mai-invoke sa

asr-001528
01:18:28.960 --> 01:18:30.240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: amin yung five years.

asr-001529
01:18:30.580 --> 01:18:35.960
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: But these are supposedly matters that should have been initiated by the Komelik Motopropyo, di ba?

asr-001530
01:18:36.060 --> 01:18:38.240
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: Kasi it's stated in the SOSE, di ba?

asr-001531
01:18:38.300 --> 01:18:39.880
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: It's under oath, it's submitted to you.

asr-001532
01:18:40.380 --> 01:18:42.560
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: Dapat kayo na po yung nag-initiate niyan, di ba?

asr-001533
01:18:42.700 --> 01:18:43.420
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po, Mr. Chair.

asr-001534
01:18:43.480 --> 01:18:48.320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: In fact, we are going to submit to this committee, para lang din po maging transpire,

asr-001535
01:18:48.400 --> 01:18:53.120
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: we are going to submit the list of cases filed by our Political Finance and Affairs Department

asr-001536
01:18:53.120 --> 01:18:57.540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: as Motopropyo initiated by that office without a need for anybody

asr-001537
01:18:57.540 --> 01:18:59.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: filing a case.

asr-001538
01:19:00.880 --> 01:19:03.960
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Because po, kita po namin eh, madali po namin makompare.

asr-001539
01:19:04.280 --> 01:19:06.320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: There was one instance, for example, in Laguna.

asr-001540
01:19:06.780 --> 01:19:12.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kinakita po namin kaagad noon na hindi siya nag-file doon sa SOSE niya.

asr-001541
01:19:12.580 --> 01:19:15.100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi siya nag-file nung kanyang ginastos.

asr-001542
01:19:15.660 --> 01:19:20.240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Samantalang, for example, yung mismong station ng radyo or television,

asr-001543
01:19:20.420 --> 01:19:22.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: nag-report, so kaya po namin makompare yun.

asr-001544
01:19:22.360 --> 01:19:26.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Even if, Mr. Chair, yung opisina po namin yun, yung PIFAD,

asr-001545
01:19:26.000 --> 01:19:31.060
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: meron po siyang 48 na tao, lahat po yun, Mr. Chair, ay mga casual employees.

asr-001546
01:19:31.200 --> 01:19:33.660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala po kaming regular office na yun.

asr-001547
01:19:34.220 --> 01:19:37.760
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And isa lang po ang aming, dalawa po ang lawyers namin, wala pong accountant doon.

asr-001548
01:19:38.120 --> 01:19:42.200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: They are able to dispose 48,000 SOSE in just a single election.

asr-001549
01:19:43.100 --> 01:19:43.620
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: Thank you.

asr-001550
01:19:44.160 --> 01:19:48.400
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: Mr. Chair, I would just like, before I leave, I would just like to manifest my support, of course,

asr-001551
01:19:48.460 --> 01:19:52.480
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: for the restoration because of the dangers that we will be facing

asr-001552
01:19:53.040 --> 01:19:55.980
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: if Comelec does not get at least a fair share.

asr-001553
01:19:56.000 --> 01:19:57.920
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: of the budget that they are asking for.

asr-001554
01:19:58.160 --> 01:20:03.100
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: But at the same time po, I hope that you will also try to resolve cases speedily po.

asr-001555
01:20:03.180 --> 01:20:08.940
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: Kasi the thing I hate the most is when a case is filed, tapos muntik na mag-election,

asr-001556
01:20:09.100 --> 01:20:11.640
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: tsaka pa mag-de-decide si Comelec.

asr-001557
01:20:11.780 --> 01:20:17.640
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: So if we can avoid that and resolve things faster siguro, I would much appreciate it po, Mr. Chair.

asr-001558
01:20:17.900 --> 01:20:18.540
Rep. Jonathan Keith T. Flores: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001559
01:20:18.540 --> 01:20:23.520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We will submit, Mr. Chair, the list and then we will likewise submit to the Committee on Electoral Reforms

asr-001560
01:20:23.520 --> 01:20:24.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: the updates on these cases.

asr-001561
01:20:24.900 --> 01:20:25.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Thank you very much.

asr-001562
01:20:26.000 --> 01:20:27.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001563
01:20:27.000 --> 01:20:30.000
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you, Representative Jonathan Kit Flores.

asr-001564
01:20:33.420 --> 01:20:38.020
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Next in line, from the minority, Representative Elijah San Fernando.

asr-001565
01:20:38.680 --> 01:20:40.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-001566
01:20:40.780 --> 01:20:43.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Chair Garcia, magandang hapon po sa Comelec family.

asr-001567
01:20:44.060 --> 01:20:48.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Meron lang po ilang mga paglilinaw na nais makuhang kinatawang ito.

asr-001568
01:20:48.640 --> 01:20:50.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Regarding po ito sa BARM elections,

asr-001569
01:20:51.900 --> 01:20:55.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: just recently po, meron pong kinansila ng candidacy ang Comelec.

asr-001570
01:20:56.060 --> 01:20:57.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ito po yung...

asr-001571
01:20:58.620 --> 01:21:01.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Candidacy ni Anwar Alamada.

asr-001572
01:21:02.680 --> 01:21:09.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pupwede niyo po ba kaming bigyan ng briefer or ng background as to what led to the cancellation of his candidacy?

asr-001573
01:21:09.660 --> 01:21:10.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-001574
01:21:10.800 --> 01:21:16.300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Without violating, because this is a hearing, without violating the rule on subjudice,

asr-001575
01:21:16.620 --> 01:21:22.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: simply because we are fully aware that our decision will be elevated to the Supreme Court by the respondent,

asr-001576
01:21:23.020 --> 01:21:25.960
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: the reason is because of the lack of residency.

asr-001577
01:21:26.580 --> 01:21:28.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Doon po kasi ay nagkaroon ng certification.

asr-001578
01:21:28.620 --> 01:21:33.740
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: mismo ang barangay na siya ay hindi domiciled doon sa area.

asr-001579
01:21:34.260 --> 01:21:37.120
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: May decision po tayo, three cases by the Supreme Court,

asr-001580
01:21:37.600 --> 01:21:44.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: that the Comelec should give the highest consideration to a certification issued by the barangay,

asr-001581
01:21:44.900 --> 01:21:46.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: being the one in charge of the place.

asr-001582
01:21:47.180 --> 01:21:51.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So yung po ang isa sa mga naging dahilan that to the belief of the Commission,

asr-001583
01:21:52.020 --> 01:21:55.060
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: not only based on that but based on other evidence available,

asr-001584
01:21:55.680 --> 01:21:58.300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: he was not able to establish domicile in that place.

asr-001585
01:21:58.620 --> 01:22:01.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Chair Garcia, doon po sa sagot niyo.

asr-001586
01:22:01.900 --> 01:22:07.020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya ako po ito na tanong, Mr. Chair, kasi hindi lang ito solely election issue.

asr-001587
01:22:07.860 --> 01:22:12.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: This has something to do with the peace process happening in BARM.

asr-001588
01:22:12.820 --> 01:22:16.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Na alam naman po natin, kaya nagkakaroon ng eleksyon ngayon sa BARM,

asr-001589
01:22:16.560 --> 01:22:21.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ay dahil yan yung matagal na pangarap na ng mga kapatid nating Bangsamoro for self-determination.

asr-001590
01:22:22.360 --> 01:22:28.460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So hindi po natin po pwedeng maipaghiwalay yung prosesong elektoral sa proseso ng usapingan,

asr-001591
01:22:28.620 --> 01:22:29.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung pangkapayapaan.

asr-001592
01:22:30.060 --> 01:22:38.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon po, Chair Garcia, sa tingin niyo po ba, kasi ito pong si Mr. Anwar Alamada,

asr-001593
01:22:39.340 --> 01:22:43.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: siya po ay isang senior MILF official, freedom fighter.

asr-001594
01:22:43.980 --> 01:22:49.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At alam naman po natin, bilang isang freedom fighter doon po sa conflict areas,

asr-001595
01:22:49.900 --> 01:22:57.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: talagang wala siyang mapagtitirmisan na lugar kung saan siya nakatira.

asr-001596
01:22:58.620 --> 01:23:05.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon kinukonsidera ng Commission on Elections, itong nuances on the ongoing peace negotiations

asr-001597
01:23:05.480 --> 01:23:11.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and the rules na nag-govern dito po sa mga tumatakbong kandidato.

asr-001598
01:23:12.020 --> 01:23:13.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At yun po yung sinusunod ng Comelec.

asr-001599
01:23:13.920 --> 01:23:16.940
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Salamat po, Mr. Chair. Tama po ang inyong napuntos.

asr-001600
01:23:17.340 --> 01:23:23.340
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At kung yan man po ay gray area, Mr. Chair, yun din po ang kadahilanan kung bakit minarapat ni Comelec

asr-001601
01:23:23.340 --> 01:23:25.320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na desisyonan ang kaso na ito.

asr-001602
01:23:25.500 --> 01:23:28.320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Una po, Mr. Chair, to protect the interest of Mr. Alamada,

asr-001603
01:23:28.620 --> 01:23:31.560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: we did not remove his name sa balota.

asr-001604
01:23:31.960 --> 01:23:34.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pinrint po namin yung kanyang pangalan sa balota.

asr-001605
01:23:34.100 --> 01:23:39.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Number two, hindi po namin sinagad ang paglalabas ng desisyon until September 14.

asr-001606
01:23:39.960 --> 01:23:41.120
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pwede po sana namin gawin yun.

asr-001607
01:23:41.240 --> 01:23:44.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ginawa po namin last week, nilabas ka agad namin yung desisyon

asr-001608
01:23:44.580 --> 01:23:48.540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: para meron po siyang sufficient time to go to the Honorable Supreme Court.

asr-001609
01:23:48.920 --> 01:23:51.440
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So that kung if people will still be voting for him,

asr-001610
01:23:52.060 --> 01:23:54.720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: or especially if he is able to get a restraining order,

asr-001611
01:23:54.720 --> 01:23:56.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: then at least po, Mr. Chair,

asr-001612
01:23:56.860 --> 01:23:58.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: lahat po ng voto niya will be considered,

asr-001613
01:23:58.620 --> 01:24:02.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: valid at hindi po siya makukonsider na stray votes.

asr-001614
01:24:02.600 --> 01:24:05.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At least binigyan po namin ng panahon siya.

asr-001615
01:24:05.340 --> 01:24:07.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At least po, yung more than two weeks na yan,

asr-001616
01:24:07.820 --> 01:24:09.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: hopefully po makapunta siya sa Korte Suprema.

asr-001617
01:24:09.960 --> 01:24:13.240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Number three, talaga pong sana because of this case,

asr-001618
01:24:13.900 --> 01:24:17.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: maging opportunity po ito sa ating kataas-taasang hukuman

asr-001619
01:24:17.900 --> 01:24:20.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: upang malinaw yung mga ganyang bagay.

asr-001620
01:24:20.580 --> 01:24:22.420
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: For example, tama po yung binabanggit ng inyong,

asr-001621
01:24:22.600 --> 01:24:25.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: your honor, ng inyo po.

asr-001622
01:24:26.160 --> 01:24:28.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Paano yung halimbawa po yung ating mga kababayan,

asr-001623
01:24:28.620 --> 01:24:31.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na peripatetic, yung bang meron siyang,

asr-001624
01:24:31.620 --> 01:24:34.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: meron po siya ay nangangalaka lang,

asr-001625
01:24:34.620 --> 01:24:37.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: pagkatapos ay napupunta sa bawat bayan,

asr-001626
01:24:37.620 --> 01:24:40.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: saan mo siya kukonsider na domicile?

asr-001627
01:24:40.620 --> 01:24:43.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Tama po kayo, walang domicile yung technically eh,

asr-001628
01:24:43.620 --> 01:24:45.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: but we have to understand that situation.

asr-001629
01:24:45.620 --> 01:24:47.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Our problem po talaga lang, Mr. Chair,

asr-001630
01:24:47.620 --> 01:24:51.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: is because of the requirements of the Local Government Code,

asr-001631
01:24:51.620 --> 01:24:54.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: of the requirements of the Bangsamoro Electoral Code,

asr-001632
01:24:54.620 --> 01:24:56.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: and of the consistent decision of the Supreme Court

asr-001633
01:24:56.620 --> 01:24:57.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na it comes to domicile.

asr-001634
01:24:57.620 --> 01:24:58.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Thank you.

asr-001635
01:24:58.620 --> 01:25:01.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, sana nga po, mag-grab itong opportunity ito,

asr-001636
01:25:01.620 --> 01:25:04.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: maliwanag talaga ito, to protect the interest,

asr-001637
01:25:04.620 --> 01:25:06.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: not only of Mr. Alamada, but likewise,

asr-001638
01:25:06.620 --> 01:25:09.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: those who will be facing the same predicament in the future.

asr-001639
01:25:09.620 --> 01:25:13.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat po, Chair Garcia, dun po sa sagot ninyo.

asr-001640
01:25:13.620 --> 01:25:17.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maaaring makatulong po ito para doon sa pagresolba

asr-001641
01:25:17.620 --> 01:25:20.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa mga ganitong usapin at sa mga susunod pang usapin.

asr-001642
01:25:20.620 --> 01:25:23.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair, kaya ako lang naman po ito binibigyang din,

asr-001643
01:25:23.620 --> 01:25:27.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dahil mahalaga po na maipasok sa usapin ng eleksyon sa BARM,

asr-001644
01:25:27.620 --> 01:25:30.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ulit yung ongoing na peace negotiation

asr-001645
01:25:30.620 --> 01:25:33.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: between the Government of the Republic of the Philippines

asr-001646
01:25:33.620 --> 01:25:35.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and the Bangsamoro people.

asr-001647
01:25:35.620 --> 01:25:39.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, paramount po kasi yung usapin ng self-determination.

asr-001648
01:25:39.620 --> 01:25:44.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, yun po ang tinitindigan natin na mapagpas siya dito sa usapin ito.

asr-001649
01:25:44.620 --> 01:25:47.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero, I am satisfied po sa sagot po ni Chair Garcia.

asr-001650
01:25:47.620 --> 01:25:50.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat po, Chair, at sa buong Comelec family.

asr-001651
01:25:50.620 --> 01:25:52.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair, your Honor.

asr-001652
01:25:52.620 --> 01:25:53.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Thank you very much po.

asr-001653
01:25:53.620 --> 01:25:55.620
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you, Kong Eli.

asr-001654
01:25:55.620 --> 01:25:56.620
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Next in line,

asr-001655
01:25:57.620 --> 01:25:59.620
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Representative Atty. JP Padiernos.

asr-001656
01:25:59.620 --> 01:26:01.620
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001657
01:26:01.620 --> 01:26:06.620
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Magandang hapon po sa ating kagalang-galang na chairperson,

asr-001658
01:26:06.620 --> 01:26:10.620
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Chair Garcia, and the rest of the Comelec family.

asr-001659
01:26:10.620 --> 01:26:13.620
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: So, may mga ano lang po ako concerned,

asr-001660
01:26:13.620 --> 01:26:16.620
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: or mga questions po, katanungan, Mr. Chair.

asr-001661
01:26:16.620 --> 01:26:23.620
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Unahin ko muna po yung ating barangay NSK elections po sa November.

asr-001662
01:26:23.620 --> 01:26:25.620
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Kasi po,

asr-001663
01:26:25.620 --> 01:26:27.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: ah,

asr-001664
01:26:27.970 --> 01:26:33.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: according to Comelec, sinabi po nila, sinabi na around,

asr-001665
01:26:33.970 --> 01:26:42.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: out of, around 8 billion of approximately 19 billion of the BSKE budget had already been spent.

asr-001666
01:26:42.970 --> 01:26:47.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: With most of the balance intended for poll worker honorary training and development,

asr-001667
01:26:47.970 --> 01:26:54.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: and another 2.5 to 3.5 billion could be required pag na-postpone po.

asr-001668
01:26:54.970 --> 01:26:55.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Ano na po ba yung status ngayon po dun sa,

asr-001669
01:26:55.970 --> 01:27:01.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: preparation po, at yung ina-mention niyo po na 8 billion na nag-gastos niya na po?

asr-001670
01:27:01.970 --> 01:27:08.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ah, lahat po ng mga kagamitan na gagamitin natin para sa barangay NSK elections noong November 2 ay nakahanda na.

asr-001671
01:27:08.970 --> 01:27:10.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Lalong-lalo na po yung mga balota.

asr-001672
01:27:10.970 --> 01:27:15.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: In fact, yung pong mga dagdag na balota, dahil nagkaroon po tayo ng dagdag na botante,

asr-001673
01:27:15.970 --> 01:27:24.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: nagkaroon po tayo ng registration from October 20 to May 18 ng 2020, ah, 2027, ah, 2026,

asr-001674
01:27:24.970 --> 01:27:29.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: and therefore, nagkaroon po tayo ng dagdag na, hindi po muna namin i-imprinta yun,

asr-001675
01:27:29.970 --> 01:27:31.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ah, pero later on, ma-i-imprinta na namin.

asr-001676
01:27:31.970 --> 01:27:37.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung pong mga iba pang dapat mag-procure, hindi po muna namin pinadeliver, pero nabili na rin po namin.

asr-001677
01:27:37.970 --> 01:27:44.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, ibig sabihin po, anytime, kahit po magpahold tayo ng election by next week, pwede namin isagawa ang barangay NSK.

asr-001678
01:27:44.970 --> 01:27:48.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang kulang po namin lang na major, as number one, yung po training ng mga guro.

asr-001679
01:27:48.970 --> 01:27:53.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We'll have to train the more or less 1 million teachers, ah, the members of the electoral board,

asr-001680
01:27:53.970 --> 01:27:57.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: including the support staff, kasi po manual na election ang barangay NSK.

asr-001681
01:27:57.970 --> 01:28:02.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And therefore, pati po yung mga DESO. And therefore, kailangan po namin ma-train sila.

asr-001682
01:28:02.970 --> 01:28:07.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At ah, dahil po dyan, yun na lang po yung critical na kulang ni Commission on Election.

asr-001683
01:28:07.970 --> 01:28:11.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung ballot boxes po, nakapag-procure kami ng dagdag na 70,000.

asr-001684
01:28:11.970 --> 01:28:16.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At anytime, pwede po namin pa-deliver yun, tutal bakal naman po yung mga ballot boxes na yan.

asr-001685
01:28:16.970 --> 01:28:22.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yun nga lang po, yung deployment, yun na lang po hinihintay natin para ma-deploy yung mga kagamitan natin.

asr-001686
01:28:23.970 --> 01:28:28.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ah, kasi kaya po nagpasabi po ang inyong lingkod sa ating pong Kongreso,

asr-001687
01:28:28.970 --> 01:28:32.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: nung magkaroon ng pagdinig dito po at sa mataas na kapulungan sa Senado,

asr-001688
01:28:32.970 --> 01:28:35.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na baka po pwede naman bago po matapos ang buwan ng September,

asr-001689
01:28:35.970 --> 01:28:39.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ay maging maliwanag kung talagang matutuloy o hindi ang halalan.

asr-001690
01:28:39.970 --> 01:28:47.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At ah, ang nangyari naman po sa Senado kasi ay hindi po siya, ah, postponement

asr-001691
01:28:47.970 --> 01:28:52.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: kung hindi po, ah, fixing of the term from four years to five years.

asr-001692
01:28:52.970 --> 01:28:57.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At dito po sa mababang kapulungan, nagkaroon na rin po ng pagdinig nung nakaraang linggo,

asr-001693
01:28:57.970 --> 01:29:03.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ay term fixing na rin po ang dininig po ng local government committee.

asr-001694
01:29:03.970 --> 01:29:06.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So yan po yung hinihintay namin sa kasalukuyan.

asr-001695
01:29:06.970 --> 01:29:10.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So hopefully po, hanggang before third week na September, baka po maging maliwanag.

asr-001696
01:29:10.970 --> 01:29:12.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Mr. Chair, follow-up question po.

asr-001697
01:29:12.970 --> 01:29:21.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Doon sa 8 billion po na nagastos na po, how much was merely obligated versus magkano po yung paid and delivered?

asr-001698
01:29:21.970 --> 01:29:27.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Tapos in addition po, ito po bang na-procure nyo na or nagastos no?

asr-001699
01:29:27.970 --> 01:29:33.970
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Can it still be used for next year's election if it will be postponed next year?

asr-001700
01:29:33.970 --> 01:29:36.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: More or less po, Mr. Chair, ang earmark natin is 4 billion.

asr-001701
01:29:36.970 --> 01:29:43.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At ang ating naman din pong obligated, more or less din po, 3.9, 4 billion na rin po halos ang obligated natin.

asr-001702
01:29:43.970 --> 01:29:49.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So all in all po, 8 billion, 3 million ang atin pong obligated at saka earmark na amount.

asr-001704
01:29:51.970 --> 01:29:59.970
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At yan naman po, para po doon sa mga nakikinig at nakamonitor sa atin, lahat naman po yun ay magagamit.

asr-001705
01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:05.660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: kung sakaling hindi matuloy ang ating halalan sa 26 November 2.

asr-001706
01:30:08.560 --> 01:30:11.180
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Okay po. So thank you po, Mr. Chair.

asr-001707
01:30:12.040 --> 01:30:20.520
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: On my second point, kasi po nagkaroon po recently ng election sa Das Marinas in Cavite.

asr-001708
01:30:22.400 --> 01:30:26.120
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: And according to news article in your report,

asr-001709
01:30:26.120 --> 01:30:34.180
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: from your supposed 200 million budget, napababa niyo po ng 128 million.

asr-001710
01:30:34.820 --> 01:30:41.980
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Plus, meron pa pong contribution yung ating LGU na around 50 million po.

asr-001711
01:30:42.340 --> 01:30:43.260
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Tama po ba yan, Mr. Chair?

asr-001712
01:30:44.240 --> 01:30:45.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Tama po kayo, Mr. Chair.

asr-001713
01:30:46.300 --> 01:30:52.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Napakalaking tulong po yung in advance sa amin po ng local government unit ng Das Marinas Cavite.

asr-001714
01:30:52.580 --> 01:30:55.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Gusto ko lang din pong sabihin for record purposes.

asr-001715
01:30:56.120 --> 01:31:00.520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Na ang omnibus election code under Section 10 ay nagsasabi na si Comelec,

asr-001716
01:31:00.880 --> 01:31:02.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: and that is a 1985 law.

asr-001717
01:31:03.100 --> 01:31:05.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Whether we agree with that or not, it's a 1985 law.

asr-001718
01:31:05.840 --> 01:31:12.260
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sabi po, the Comelec can ask the local government unit to advance expenses that will be incurred

asr-001719
01:31:12.260 --> 01:31:14.640
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: for purposes of the conduct of any special election.

asr-001720
01:31:15.100 --> 01:31:16.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung po yung ginawa sa atin.

asr-001721
01:31:16.760 --> 01:31:21.440
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At this point po, Mr. Chair, hindi naman po namin po mababayaran o maibabalik sa LGU

asr-001722
01:31:21.440 --> 01:31:24.500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sapagkat kinakailangan po muna may pumasok na savings.

asr-001723
01:31:24.500 --> 01:31:26.100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: E base po sa desisyon.

asr-001724
01:31:26.120 --> 01:31:31.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang Supreme Court sa atin sa DAP cases, savings can only be incurred kapag po natapos na ang year.

asr-001725
01:31:32.420 --> 01:31:35.140
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And therefore, sa ngayon, wala pa po kami savings para maibalik.

asr-001726
01:31:35.520 --> 01:31:42.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Napakalaking tulong po yun sapagkat ginamit po namin yung 50 million sa pagpapabigay ng onorarya sa ating mga guro.

asr-001727
01:31:42.480 --> 01:31:47.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And for the information likewise of the body, for the second time in the history of the Commission,

asr-001728
01:31:47.980 --> 01:31:52.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: on the night of the election, nabayaran po namin ang lahat ng mga guro na nagsilbi sa election.

asr-001729
01:31:52.880 --> 01:31:56.100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Una na po ang antipolo dito po sa Das Marinas.

asr-001730
01:31:56.120 --> 01:31:58.240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi po kami naghintay ng 15 days.

asr-001731
01:31:58.340 --> 01:32:01.540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: On the same night, nagbayad na rin po kami sa mga guro.

asr-001732
01:32:01.680 --> 01:32:04.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So again, that is still subject to reimbursement.

asr-001733
01:32:04.460 --> 01:32:06.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yan naman po yung exact wordings ng batas natin.

asr-001734
01:32:07.520 --> 01:32:08.900
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: That's very good to hear.

asr-001735
01:32:09.020 --> 01:32:13.260
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Actually, hindi rin po aware na it was an advance.

asr-001736
01:32:13.820 --> 01:32:17.480
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Meaning, babayaran nyo ulit, pabalik.

asr-001737
01:32:17.760 --> 01:32:18.280
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Tama po yan.

asr-001738
01:32:18.640 --> 01:32:19.560
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Tama po, Mr. Chair.

asr-001739
01:32:20.440 --> 01:32:22.280
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: But is it common practice po?

asr-001740
01:32:22.280 --> 01:32:24.440
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: I know you mentioned na nasa batas po yan.

asr-001741
01:32:24.580 --> 01:32:26.000
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Pero, is that common?

asr-001742
01:32:26.120 --> 01:32:33.120
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Is it common practice na ang LGU, pag nagkakaroon po ng vacancy, nag-a-advance po?

asr-001743
01:32:33.780 --> 01:32:41.880
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: And wala po bang, siyempre may mga nag-raise po ng issue na since yung tumakbo is part of the LGU,

asr-001744
01:32:42.320 --> 01:32:44.560
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: there's some sort of conflict of interest.

asr-001745
01:32:45.080 --> 01:32:46.000
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Can you, ano po, expand?

asr-001746
01:32:46.000 --> 01:32:47.200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

asr-001747
01:32:47.340 --> 01:32:50.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Actually po, may mga nag-question, especially sa social media.

asr-001748
01:32:51.160 --> 01:32:55.260
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Lalo na po sa part ng local government unit, hindi naman po sa part ni Comel.

asr-001749
01:32:55.260 --> 01:32:56.100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kasi, sinabi ko,

asr-001750
01:32:56.120 --> 01:33:01.460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sabi namin, ang pag-gastos ng kahit anong item, kami ang may final say, kami ang may desisyon,

asr-001751
01:33:01.820 --> 01:33:04.120
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: hindi yung nagbigay na local government unit.

asr-001752
01:33:04.200 --> 01:33:07.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ito po yung pangatlong pagkakataon na ang Comelic ay nabigyan ng advance.

asr-001753
01:33:08.420 --> 01:33:10.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Katulad po, yan nangyari na po yung sa Campostela Valley,

asr-001754
01:33:11.340 --> 01:33:14.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: nagkaroon din po ng ganyang special election.

asr-001755
01:33:14.180 --> 01:33:16.940
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At nangyari na rin po ito, dyan po sa Cavite,

asr-001756
01:33:17.440 --> 01:33:21.120
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: nung pong mabakantihan ang posisyon ni dating congressman,

asr-001757
01:33:21.780 --> 01:33:24.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ngayon ay ombudsman, Boying Remulia.

asr-001758
01:33:24.880 --> 01:33:26.080
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nung siya po yung matalaga.

asr-001759
01:33:26.120 --> 01:33:31.220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Bilang Secretary of Justice, kami po ay tinulungan din ng Provincial Government of Cavite

asr-001760
01:33:31.220 --> 01:33:34.500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at kami po ay nakapagbalik naman ng pondo rin po sa kanila.

asr-001761
01:33:34.640 --> 01:33:40.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, hindi po ito extraordinary or unusual sapagkat nasa batas.

asr-001762
01:33:41.000 --> 01:33:46.540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sabi nga po namin, maaaring hindi lang nari-research ng lahat yung provision po yun ng batas.

asr-001763
01:33:47.060 --> 01:33:50.200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang pinaka-importante po, Mr. Chair, yung desisyon ng Korte Suprema

asr-001764
01:33:50.200 --> 01:33:53.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa Hagedorn versus the House of Representatives.

asr-001765
01:33:54.240 --> 01:33:56.040
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa pagkat, nagkaroon po nang,

asr-001766
01:33:56.120 --> 01:34:00.680
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: nagpagbabago ng prinsipyo at ang mismong Korte Suprema.

asr-001767
01:34:00.800 --> 01:34:05.180
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nung una po, si Comelec ay hindi mag-hold ng kahit na anong special election.

asr-001768
01:34:05.980 --> 01:34:11.380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kahit pa may namatay, o nag-resign, o natanggal na membro ng House of Representatives.

asr-001769
01:34:11.640 --> 01:34:15.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung walang, number one, declaration of vacancy by the House of Representatives.

asr-001770
01:34:16.300 --> 01:34:18.420
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Number two, call for a special election.

asr-001771
01:34:18.420 --> 01:34:20.340
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung natatandaan po natin, Mr. Chair,

asr-001772
01:34:20.340 --> 01:34:28.140
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at ang tinangga po ni Secretary Gatchalian, Rex Gatchalian, ang posisyon ng DSWD.

asr-001773
01:34:28.960 --> 01:34:31.080
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dati po siyang Congresswoman ng Valenzuela.

asr-001774
01:34:31.680 --> 01:34:35.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Subalit, hindi po nagkaroon na special election sa pagkat ng congressman

asr-001775
01:34:35.580 --> 01:34:39.200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sapagkat hindi po nagpatawag ang kongreso at that time.

asr-001776
01:34:39.280 --> 01:34:42.240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Namatay po si Congressman Salvame ng Palawan.

asr-001777
01:34:42.780 --> 01:34:45.500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi po nagpatawag ang mababang kapulungan

asr-001778
01:34:45.500 --> 01:34:49.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: pero diniklara po ng mababang kapulungan o vacant ang posisyon.

asr-001779
01:34:49.400 --> 01:34:54.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dito po sa kaso ni Haguidoin ay hindi po kami nag-hold ng election,

asr-001780
01:34:55.000 --> 01:34:58.280
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ng special election, sapagkat wala pong deklarasyon ng House of Representatives.

asr-001781
01:34:58.900 --> 01:35:01.860
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala rin pong pagpapatawag ng special election.

asr-001782
01:35:02.280 --> 01:35:05.660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Subalit, dinala po ng pamilya ng yumaong Congressman Haguidoin

asr-001783
01:35:05.660 --> 01:35:07.460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ang issue sa Korte Suprema.

asr-001784
01:35:07.560 --> 01:35:09.240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At ang sabi ng Korte Suprema, number one,

asr-001785
01:35:09.700 --> 01:35:11.420
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: hindi kinakailangang umasa ni Comelec

asr-001786
01:35:11.420 --> 01:35:14.680
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa kahit na anong declaration of vacancy by the House of Representatives.

asr-001787
01:35:15.240 --> 01:35:18.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Number two, dapat kung walang budget,

asr-001788
01:35:18.160 --> 01:35:23.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ay gawa ng paraan ni Comelec na mahanapan ng budget ang special election.

asr-001789
01:35:23.660 --> 01:35:27.120
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Number three, dapat gawin ang special election 30 days

asr-001790
01:35:27.120 --> 01:35:31.500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: or not more than, not earlier than 60 days from the vacancy

asr-001791
01:35:31.500 --> 01:35:34.760
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: but not later than 90 days after the vacancy.

asr-001792
01:35:35.160 --> 01:35:38.700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At pwedeng umasa lang si Comelec sa social media,

asr-001793
01:35:39.060 --> 01:35:44.180
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa television report, newspaper reports, or sa radio reports.

asr-001794
01:35:44.560 --> 01:35:45.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yun na po ang basihan namin.

asr-001795
01:35:45.600 --> 01:35:47.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Meaning, mandatory.

asr-001796
01:35:48.160 --> 01:35:50.700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: For the Comelec to call for a special election.

asr-001797
01:35:50.820 --> 01:35:52.700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kaya nga po, kanina rin po, Mr. Chair,

asr-001798
01:35:53.200 --> 01:35:58.180
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: I respectfully, I called the attention of the members of the House of Representatives.

asr-001799
01:35:58.780 --> 01:36:00.920
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 11 million po laging binibigay sa amin.

asr-001800
01:36:01.880 --> 01:36:03.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: To conduct an election,

asr-001801
01:36:03.900 --> 01:36:05.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: pag hindi po kakayanin ng 11 million lang,

asr-001802
01:36:05.940 --> 01:36:07.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: pang barangay lang po talaga yun,

asr-001803
01:36:07.200 --> 01:36:07.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: but just the same,

asr-001804
01:36:08.600 --> 01:36:10.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sabi namin, baka po pwedeng mataasa na

asr-001805
01:36:10.800 --> 01:36:14.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: because ngayon po, hindi na po magpapatawag ang House.

asr-001806
01:36:14.020 --> 01:36:16.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Si Comelec na lang po ang obligado

asr-001807
01:36:16.660 --> 01:36:18.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na mag-call for a special election.

asr-001808
01:36:18.160 --> 01:36:20.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Mr. Chair, just to be clear,

asr-001809
01:36:20.160 --> 01:36:22.160
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: ito pong 128 million,

asr-001810
01:36:22.160 --> 01:36:24.160
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: ano po yung line item natin?

asr-001811
01:36:24.160 --> 01:36:26.160
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Saan po kinuha ng Comelec yan?

asr-001812
01:36:26.160 --> 01:36:28.160
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Yung po sa mga supplies po namin,

asr-001813
01:36:28.160 --> 01:36:30.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung po mga natira naming savings

asr-001814
01:36:30.160 --> 01:36:32.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ng mga nakakaraang taon,

asr-001815
01:36:32.160 --> 01:36:34.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at pagkatapos po,

asr-001816
01:36:34.160 --> 01:36:36.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung pong nasaved,

asr-001817
01:36:36.160 --> 01:36:38.160
