asr-004126
02:59:33.920 --> 02:59:35.940
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Declaration of Policies and State

asr-004127
02:59:35.940 --> 02:59:38.260
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Declaration of Principles and State Policy.

asr-004128
02:59:38.720 --> 02:59:40.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nangangulugan, hindi lang po kababaihan

asr-004129
